# ── Experiment debris ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Output of local GPU runs and one-off analysis. None of it is
# reproducible from the repo, and all of it accumulates in the working
# tree until `git status` is unreadable — which is how the untracked
# PHASE_PLAN sat unversioned long enough to be a single disk failure
# from a real problem.
#
# Anything here that should survive belongs in tests/fixtures/ (pinned
# inputs), docs/assets/ (published figures), or examples/ (curated
# outputs), all of which are tracked.

*.log
*.tar.gz
runs/
_demo_check/

# One-off scripts and scratch at the repo root only. Real scripts live
# in scripts/ and real tests in tests/, neither of which this matches.
/run*.py
/sanity_*.py
/temp.sh

# Figures rendered into the repo root by a bare `lmdiff plot-geometry`
# or a scratch render. Published figures live in docs/assets/.
/*.png

# Family-experiment outputs alongside the curated examples/ ones.
examples/*_radar.png
examples/*_diagnostic.json
